ps://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-03T12:03:12Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T12:03:59Z","body":"I just realized we have navigation benchmarks on https://github.com/godotengine/godot-benchmarks! Thanks be to @OverloadedOrama 🙏\r\n\r\nResults suggest that `A*` is about as fast as before, with ~10% improvement in 3 tests, and a ~2% regression in 1 test:\r\n- **navigation/astar_2d/astar_5000_times_5000_points**: `452.5` -> `403.6` (1.12x)\r\n- **navigation/astar_3d/astar_1000_times_1000_points**:  `374.0` -> `382.2` (0.98x)\r\n- **navigation/moving_agents_2d/1000_moving_agents**: `0.008` -> `0.008` (1x)\r\n- **navigation/moving_agents_3d/1000_moving_agents**: `0.013` -> `0.012` (1.08x)\r\n- **navigation/navigation_2d/navigation_10_000_random_paths**:  `11.2` -> `11.09` (1.01x)\r\n- **navigation/navigation_3d/navigation_10_000_random_paths**: `12.4` -> `10.73` (1.16x)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2934921857/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2940649793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106996#issuecomment-2940649793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106996","id":2940649793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vRsFB","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-04T16:24:10Z","updated_at":"2025-06-04T16:24:10Z","body":"> CC @smix8 Do you happen to have any demo scenes laying around that could be used to validate a change in performance for A-Star specifically?\r\n\r\nI dont have any special demo for the AStar classes outside what is already flying around.\r\n\r\nFor the NavigationServer I don't think there are any uses for the OAHashMap. It uses AHashMap for nearly everything now because the iteration and lookups are way faster.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2940649793/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2943789774","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106996